    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Routine IV rate ⍉more than 10 mEq/h; hypokalemic arrhythmia: up to 40 mEq/h via a central v., only w cont ♡ monitoring"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
